OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FSqually rain
OL,6,Fand showers will continue to clear to
OL,7,Fthe east this evening, with most areas
OL,8,Fbecoming dry overnight with clear
OL,9,Fspells developing. A generally mild
OL,10,Fnight with some mist and fog patches
OL,11,Fforming by dawn.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FA cloudy start on Sunday with
OL,14,Fsunny spells soon giving way to
OL,15,Fshowers, these will prove heavy with
OL,16,Fthunder and hail during the afternoon
OL,17,Fand evening. Temperatures close to
OL,18,Fnormal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
